            "value": [
              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "This dataset contains documentation for the <a href=\"https://www.nwo.nl/en/projects/40119038\" type=\"_blank\">NWO-funded</a> Replication Study '(Re)counting the Uncounted. Replication and Contextualisation of Dutch and Belgian Premodern Population Estimates (1350-1800)'.\n\n<br><br>The data of the '(Re)counting the Uncounted' project is structured as follows:<br><br>\n<li><strong>Catalogue and typology of premodern censuses in the Low Countries:</strong> <a href=\"https://hdl.handle.net/10622/4FWVNL\" target=\"_blank\">hdl:10622/4FWVNL</a>.</li>\n<li><strong>Repository of digitised premodern censuses:</strong> <a href=\"https://hdl.handle.net/10622/E5BC1Y\" target=\"_blank\">hdl:10622/E5BC1Y</a>.</li>\n<li><strong>Links between census observations and <a href=\"https://hdl.handle.net/10622/PGFYTM\" target=\"_blank\">historical GIS boundaries</a>:</strong> <a href=\"https://hdl.handle.net/10622/9ZTT0C\" target=\"_blank\">hdl:10622/9ZTT0C</a>.</li>\n\n<br><br>As the database grows further over the next year, this documentation will also include replication instructions to replicate our work."
                },
                "dsDescriptionDate": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionDate",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "2023-04-05"
                }
              }
